---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About - Mono Studio"
  description="Mono Studio makes focused iPhone apps for daily practice. One useful thing, without accounts, advertising or unnecessary noise."
>
  <style>
    .container {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 32px 100px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: breatheIn 0.8s ease-out 0.2s forwards;
    }

    .back {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-faint);
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .back:hover { color: var(--text-soft); }
    .back span { margin-right: 6px; font-size: 14px; }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
      font-weight: 200;
      font-size: 28px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
      font-weight: 300;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--text-soft);
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    a:not(.back) {
      color: inherit;
      text-underline-offset: 3px;
      text-decoration-color: var(--border);
      transition: text-decoration-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    a:not(.back):hover { text-decoration-color: var(--text-soft); }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 72px;
      padding-top: 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-copy {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .container { padding: 48px 24px 80px; }
      h1 { font-size: 24px; }
    }
  </style>

  <main class="container">
    <a href="/" class="back"><span>←</span> Mono Studio</a>

    <h1>About</h1>
    <h2>Small apps for daily practice</h2>
    <p>
      Mono Studio makes focused iPhone apps that do one useful thing without accounts, advertising or unnecessary noise.
      <a href="/keel">Keel</a> follows a weight trend, <a href="/fork">Fork</a> tunes an instrument,
      <a href="/enso">Enso</a> keeps a daily drawing practice and <a href="/bins">Bins</a> remembers collection day.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each app is designed to take seconds, keep its data on the device and become more useful through repetition rather than attention.
    </p>

    <footer class="footer">
      <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 Mono Studio</p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
